    category: "General",
    content: `Last Updated: March 2018  
Section 1 General Information
These rules apply to all teams registered within Calgary Minor Basketball (CMBA) when playing in any competition, organized or sanctioned, by CMBA. 


Where matters are not specified herein, the rules and Regulations of Canada Basketball and International Basketball Federation (FIBA) shall apply in the order listed.`,
