    id: "1s-KLOnNkDmR5r5DSF9n165Nj4LDoolebH_oEHSi1mBY",
    title: "Section 3 Fees",
    category: "General",
    content: `Last Updated: June 2018  
Section 3 Fees


3.1. Cost Per Team


The cost per team to the association, will be determined by the CMBA Executive, and approved by the CMBA Board, prior to the start of all member zones/associations registration for the upcoming season. This will allow the members to set their player fees accordingly.


3.2. Team Registration


Zones/Association team registration forms and fees not submitted by the team registration deadline, will be assessed a one hundred ($100.00) dollar late fee.


3.3. Refunds


No refund of registration fees will be granted for withdrawal of a team after the schedule has been posted on the CMBA website.`,
